DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10416::$$$message_0079_0000_0000$$$::The afternoon homeroom period ends and we all head out.[lr]::
10417::$$$message_0079_0000_0001$$$::Students who go straight home, students who hurry to their club practice, students who are just talking[line len=2]the hallway is almost as lively as lunch break.[lr]::
10418::$$$message_0079_0000_0002$$$::I don't have any plans, and I don't have work.[lr]::
10419::$$$message_0079_0000_0003$$$::So I'm part of the straight home group, and[line len=2]::
10420::$$$message_0079_0001_0000$$$::"Emiya, I have something to talk about. Stay behind, please."[lr]::
10421::$$$message_0079_0001_0001$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
10422::$$$message_0079_0001_0002$$$::Fuji-nee stops me with a serious expression.[lr]::
10423::$$$message_0079_0001_0003$$$::She's "Ms. Fujimura" at times like this, so I have to respond seriously as a student.::
10424::$$$message_0079_0002_0000$$$::"What is it, Ms. Fujimura?"[lr]::
10425::$$$message_0079_0002_0001$$$::"Don't 'what is it' me.[lr]::
10426::$$$message_0079_0002_0002$$$::Emiya, you haven't decided where you want to go after graduation, have you? Did you forget that I said to turn it in by this week?"::
10427::$$$message_0079_0003_0000$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
10428::$$$message_0079_0003_0001$$$::I did forget.[lr]::
10429::$$$message_0079_0003_0002$$$::...Wait. It's October already. I haven't narrowed everything down by now?[lr]::
10430::$$$message_0079_0003_0003$$$::I suppose it's only natural for this Ms. Fujimura persona to make her appearance now.::
10431::$$$message_0079_0004_0000$$$::"I'm sorry. Um, I would like some more time, is that possible?"[lr]::
10432::$$$message_0079_0004_0001$$$::"It is not. Turn it in by today. It is only you and Miss Makidera that have not decided as third years. Decide before Miss Makidera beats you to it.[lr]::
10433::$$$message_0079_0004_0002$$$::Well, I'll cut you some slack since it's so last minute."[lr]::
10434::$$$message_0079_0004_0003$$$::Ms. Fujimura takes out the student path survey report.::
10435::$$$message_0079_0005_0000$$$::"...So I just have to fill in the spaces since it's last minute?"[lr]::
10436::$$$message_0079_0005_0001$$$::"Yes. [cacheimage storage=藤10b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=藤10b(中)]It's a headache as your homeroom teacher and guardian, but you'll be called to the faculty room if you don't."[lr]::
10437::$$$message_0079_0005_0002$$$::Ms. Fujimura[line len=2]no, Fuji-nee[line len=2]sighs dramatically.::
10438::$$$message_0079_0006_0000$$$::"Understood. Then give me a bit of time."[lr]::
10439::$$$message_0079_0006_0001$$$::"Very well. I have time, so I'll keep you company until the sun sets."[lr]::
10440::$$$message_0079_0006_0002$$$::So she says.[lr]::
10441::$$$message_0079_0006_0003$$$::I was thinking of going to a local college up until last year, but plans have taken a dramatic turn as of late.[lr]::
10442::$$$message_0079_0006_0004$$$::She says it's fine since this is last minute, but I really ought to be thinking about this carefully, right...?::
10443::$$$message_0079_0007_0000$$$::After debating for a while, I did my best to fill out the student path survey seriously.::
10444::$$$message_0079_0008_0000$$$::"Thank you for waiting. Here, Ms. Fujimura."[lr]::
10445::$$$message_0079_0008_0001$$$::"Okay, good work. Hmm, let's see.[lr]::
10446::$$$message_0079_0008_0002$$$::...So, your first choice is undecided.[lr]::
10447::$$$message_0079_0008_0003$$$::Your second choice is...studying abroad? Third choice is law and politics, huh?[lr]::
10448::$$$message_0079_0008_0004$$$::Your goal until last year has dropped to third, is there any reason for that, Shirou?"::
10449::$$$message_0079_0009_0000$$$::"It's not that I lost interest, but rather, I have higher priorities now.[lr]::
10450::$$$message_0079_0009_0001$$$::Can they not all be the same priority...for now?"[lr]::
10451::$$$message_0079_0009_0002$$$::"That's an inarticulate answer for you, Shirou. But undecided as the same priority? Does that mean you'll work after graduating?"[lr]::
10452::$$$message_0079_0009_0003$$$::"I would want to work if I can find a good place. Somewhere I can actually be of help and be able to reach people."::
10453::$$$message_0079_0010_0000$$$::"Mrgh... Then, what about your second choice of studying abroad? Your grades in English are average, right, Shirou? Putting listening aside, pronunciation is pretty tough.[lr]::
10454::$$$message_0079_0010_0001$$$::I don't know. Why are you bringing up studying abroad? Is it Tohsaka's influence?"::
10455::$$$message_0079_0011_0000$$$::"No, it's more like resolution instead of influence. I can't rely on Tohsaka forever if I'm going to study seriously. I thought I'd also need to be thrown into the real place."[lr]::
10456::$$$message_0079_0011_0001$$$::"Mm. 'Seriously,' like Kiritsugu?"[lr]::
10457::$$$message_0079_0011_0002$$$::"..."::
10458::$$$message_0079_0012_0000$$$::For a moment, I'm at a loss for words.[lr]::
10459::$$$message_0079_0012_0001$$$::What she means is if I want to wander around foreign countries like my old man.[lr]::
10460::$$$message_0079_0012_0002$$$::Fuji-nee knows more than anyone else of my admiration for the man. That's what she's picking up from the abroad option, completely putting aside Tohsaka's influence.::
10461::$$$message_0079_0013_0000$$$::"I don't know. I don't know about the future, but I think it will be a different path from my old man."[lr]::
10462::$$$message_0079_0013_0001$$$::"...Mm. I see, so you've decided already."[lr]::
10463::$$$message_0079_0013_0002$$$::So, the second choice.[lr]::
10464::$$$message_0079_0013_0003$$$::Fuji-nee casually circles the second column of the survey form in red.::
10465::$$$message_0079_0014_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
10466::$$$message_0079_0014_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
10467::$$$message_0079_0014_0002$$$::I hear the commotion of the club activities from the schoolyard.[lr]::
10468::$$$message_0079_0014_0003$$$::The classroom is quiet, as if there are no people.[lr]::
10469::$$$message_0079_0014_0004$$$::Fuji-nee, staring at the podium in front, and me sitting at the desk makes for a quiet, empty scene.::
10470::$$$message_0079_0015_0000$$$::"Um. I can't stop a student's autonomy as a teacher, but can I ask one thing?"[lr]::
10471::$$$message_0079_0015_0001$$$::"Yeah, what?"[lr]::
10472::$$$message_0079_0015_0002$$$::That is...[lr]::
10473::$$$message_0079_0015_0003$$$::"Shirou, will you come back?"[lr]::
10474::$$$message_0079_0015_0004$$$::...words hinting at a time to come, as if to secure a promise for the future, or perhaps a promise of days long past.::
10475::$$$message_0079_0016_0000$$$::"...I'll come back. Multiple times a year. I have to take care of the house, right?"[lr]::
10476::$$$message_0079_0016_0001$$$::"Oh, okay. Well, I'll have to make sure to be there for you then![lr]::
10477::$$$message_0079_0016_0002$$$::I'll protect the house while you're not here, so you can go anywhere you wish!"::
10478::$$$message_0079_0017_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
10479::$$$message_0079_0017_0001$$$::A radiant smile.[lr]::
10480::$$$message_0079_0017_0002$$$::Even if I were to go somewhere far...[lr]::
10481::$$$message_0079_0017_0003$$$::Where else in the world could I ever find a smile as strong as that?::
10482::$$$message_0079_0018_0000$$$::"...Thanks, Fuji-nee.[lr]::
10483::$$$message_0079_0018_0001$$$::I don't think it'll happen, but please look after the house in that case."[lr]::
10484::$$$message_0079_0018_0002$$$::"You too, Shirou. If you're going to go somewhere else, you better come back bigger."[lr]::
10485::$$$message_0079_0018_0003$$$::She replies with unwavering warmth.[lr]::
10486::$$$message_0079_0018_0004$$$::This is the last autumn before my route will drastically change.[lr]::
10487::$$$message_0079_0018_0005$$$::Another promise that cannot be broken was made in this classroom with just the two of us.::
910431::$$$message_9079_0004_0000$$$::"I'm sorry. Um, I would like some more time, is that possible?"[r]::�